valves.description:
**Hold devices:** If a thermostat is changed by hand, ThermGenie sets it back at once. With a heating lock this always applies.

**Valves:** If a valve stays open although its radiator should close, you get a warning after the waiting time. With a heating lock an open valve also triggers the lock.

